+More-specific dispatch still applies
+------------------------------------
+
+A union handler does not override a handler registered for a concrete
+subclass that is more specific than any member of the union:
+
+>>> @handler.register(bool)
+... def bool_handler(x):
+...     return "bool"
+>>>
+>>> handler(True)
+'bool'
+>>> handler(42)
+'union'
+
